      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that. but wait, i think that's a bit too one-sided for a formal document. won't the board of directors get upset if we don't mention the benefits of keeping things here? like, people argue that these museums are \"universal\" and that having everything in one place helps more people learn about history. can you rewrite it to include that side so it sounds more balanced?",
